  "description": "It's really amazing what kids are capable of on two wheels these days at an ever younger age. For a long time, the limiting factor in mountain biking was the equipment. But when specially designed technology is available for even the smallest children, safety, control and comfort are the basis for truly bringing out talent. The Frechdax 3 offers exactly that and opens up the field of application of full suspension mountain bikes for youngsters. Sixpack 1st Ride components, which were developed precisely based on the needs of kids, in combination with selected products from well-known manufacturers and the sophisticated geometry of the lightweight aluminum frame make the Frechdax 3 what it is: the tool for young shredders that sets no limits! The Frechdax 3 is recommended for children between 110 cm and 135 cm (5 to 8 years).",
